fixture cam_down_held_in_air
doc camera review round 2, M6 (docs/adr/0011): walk off the high shelf and hold the stick straight down through a fall of about 40 ticks. Look-down is a request made standing crouched on the ground; the stick held down in the air is not one (a camera that read the stick alone would look down 20 ticks into the fall).
room test/camera
spawn 5400 960
frames 120
input
  0..20 R
  21..119 D
end
expect
  never 22..60 state=ground
end
